     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.code [ fhir:value "SP-2010-4540" ] ;
     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.display [ fhir:value "PA, reconstruction (plasty), Branch, Central (within the hilar bifurcation)" ] ;
     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Reconstruction of the right or left branch (or both right and left) pulmonary arteries (within the hilar bifurcation) commonly using patch material. If balloon angioplasty is performed or a stent is placed in the right or left (or both) pulmonary artery intraoperatively, this code may be used in addition to the balloon dilation or stent placement code. If, rarely, branch PA banding (single or bilateral) was performed in the past and reconstruction is performed associated with debanding, both codes should be listed." ] ;
